---
// [WEB-GATEWAY-INT 2026-09-18] Removed idea (companionship-coded "close
// friends" format, see Specs/WEBGW-INT-REPORT.md) — permanent-redirect so any
// indexed/shared link still resolves. A literal sibling file, not a
// public/_redirects entry: this site's _routes.json exclude list is already
// at Cloudflare's 100-rule cap (Specs/WEBGW-INT-REPORT.md), so a new
// _redirects line for this exact path was silently dropped and the URL fell
// through to the Worker, which rendered a 200 instead of a 301. A literal
// route wins routing precedence over the sibling [slug].astro and needs no
// _routes.json exclude entry at all, since prerender=false pages always run
// through the Worker.
export const prerender = false;
return Astro.redirect('/global-ideas', 301);
---
